179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 131 0 R
/E (To improve the accuracy of the fog harvesting model, I would collect more data over a longer period of time, and under a variety of weather conditions. I would also adjust the model's equations to better account for changes in humidity, wind speed, and temperature, since our current model sometimes predicts zero fog yield when water is actually collected.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
